  "description": "Available now.\n\n**When applying for this property, please provide as much information as possible about all applicants. The more information we have the better as we receive a large amount of applications daily**\n\nGet Let is delighted to present this two-bed modern home to the rental market. Located in a nice neighbourhood on Temple Court, off Arbour Hill, this property is a stones throw from the Phoenix Park, it is within walking distance to the city centre with numerous transport systems on its doorstep such as the LUAS a short walk away and many bus routes. Manor Street is a three minute walk away and is home to many shops, restaurants and cafes offering a wide range of choice.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a living room to the front, a spacious and modern open plan kitchen with all mod cons to the rear leading out to a peaceful back yard. Two double bedrooms upstairs and a family bathroom with an electric shower and bath complete the property.\n\nThis property is in great condition and in an ideal location so viewing is highly recommended.\n\nTo arrange a viewing please email Michelle Hoare using the Send Message link and submit a brief application with details about yourselves. Private viewings shall then take place by appointment only.\n\nGet Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, PSRA number 002324.\n\nNotice\nAll photographs are provided for guidance only.",
